---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import LegalPage from "@/components/LegalPage.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Contact - MeshCore SAR"
  description="Questions, feedback, support, and SAR team deployment help for MeshCore SAR."
  width="prose"
>
  <LegalPage
    kicker="MeshCore SAR"
    title="Contact"
    backHref="/meshcore-sar/"
    backLabel="MeshCore SAR"
  >
    <p>
      Questions, feedback, or support for MeshCore SAR:
      <a href="mailto:hey@dz0ny.dev">hey@dz0ny.dev</a>
    </p>

    <h2>Reporting an issue</h2>
    <p>If something is broken or you want a feature, include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Your device model and operating system version</li>
      <li>MeshCore device firmware version, if relevant</li>
      <li>What went wrong, or what you would like the app to do</li>
      <li>Steps to reproduce the problem, if it is a bug</li>
      <li>Network configuration details such as frequency and mesh settings</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>SAR team deployments</h2>
    <p>
      For organizations deploying MeshCore SAR in search and rescue work, I can help with
      infrastructure planning and deployment, training and setup, custom configuration, and
      integration with an existing MeshCore network.
    </p>

    <p>I read everything and reply as soon as I can.</p>
  </LegalPage>
</Layout>
